---
import League from '../layouts/League.astro';
---
<League title="About" description="About Riverbend Youth Soccer.">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h1>About the league</h1>
    <p>Riverbend Youth Soccer is a fictional league created to show Nest Co.'s website work. The details here are invented.</p>
    <h2>What we believe</h2>
    <p>Every kid gets to play. Everyone plays at least half of every game, and standings matter less than showing up and having fun.</p>
    <h2>Safety</h2>
    <p>All coaches complete a background check and a short safety course. We follow a concussion protocol and a lightning rule: when thunder is heard, everyone leaves the field.</p>
  </div>
</League>
